# Waiting for a condition instead of guessing how long it takes.
#
# A flat scenario file has to name an absolute time for the turn, which
# means computing the climb by hand and redoing it whenever the starting
# altitude is edited. Here the loop waits for the aircraft itself.
scenario "Wait for level, then turn"

fix VOMAN 12.95 77.67

flight AI202 type A320 enter VOMAN alt FL240 hdg 090 spd 280KT

clear AI202 climb FL320

# Advance in ten-second steps until the aircraft reaches FL300.
let waited = 0
while AI202.alt < FL300 do
  advance 10
  waited = waited + 10
end

print "reached FL300 after ", waited, " seconds"
clear AI202 heading 270
advance 120

assert AI202.alt >= FL300, "the aircraft should have passed FL300"
